{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31312","headline":"遣怀寄欧阳秀才 · 刘威","name":"遣怀寄欧阳秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地上江河天上乌，百年流转只须臾。\n平生闲过日将日，欲老始知吾负吾。\n似豹一班时或有，如龟三顾岂全无。\n古来晚达人何限，莫笑空枝犹望苏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘威","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}